# Obtain your application's own credentials at https://my.telegram.org/apps
# For a Finder install, save a filled-in copy as:
# ~/Library/Application Support/Slopogram Native/.env
TELEGRAM_API_ID=
TELEGRAM_API_HASH=
# Optional: SOCKS5 proxy for Telegram connections (socks5://host:port).
# Unset on macOS to use the system SOCKS proxy, if enabled.
# SLOPOGRAM_PROXY=socks5://127.0.0.1:1080
# Optional: override the OS-specific application data directory.
# SLOPOGRAM_DATA_DIR=/absolute/path/to/private/slopogram-data
